  },
  en: {
    title: "Savings Product Comparison — After-tax Returns Compared",
    description: "Compare fixed deposits, installment savings, ISA, and high-yield savings accounts by after-tax returns (15.4% interest tax applied).",
  },
  ja: {
    title: "貯蓄商品比較計算機 — 税引き後受取額で最適商品を比較",
