    steps: ["Enter your monthly savings amount and term.", "Adjust each product's expected annual rate to match the offer you are reviewing.", "Run the comparison to see gross interest, tax, and after-tax total.", "Before signing up, check tax exemption limits, early-withdrawal rules, deposit protection, and liquidity."],
